      'For family or shared households, clarify who the account owner is and how gifts transfer. Ambiguous ownership is a quiet source of canceled-by-the-wrong-person drama. One sentence on the join page prevents a category of support chats that are really family logistics.',
      'After each major packaging redesign, retest whether inserts still explain skips and cancel paths. Beautiful boxes that bury the mechanics undo months of careful product-page work. Inserts are product copy too.',
