      'Review captions before boost spend. Organic misfires are manageable; paid amplification of unapproved medical or permanence claims is expensive. A twenty-minute review queue for boosted user content pays for itself the first time you catch a banned phrase. Customer photo captions you write as a brand when reposting need different care than creator partnerships. Add attribution, avoid rewriting someone’s medical story into a claim, and keep any brand overlay text inside approved language.',
