      'Kids, pets, and regulated categories need extra caption constraints. Even affectionate anecdotes can imply results you cannot claim. Brief those verticals with category-specific red lists. After major product-page claim changes, notify active creators within forty-eight hours. Yesterday’s approved caption can become today’s liability if the formulation or warranty shifted overnight.',
