      'Have someone outside the brand read the product page aloud. Stumbling points in speech often mark sentences that fail silent scanning too. Rewriting for the ear improves mobile comprehension. Budget a freeze window: no major page experiments on SKUs taking heavy spend that week. Audits mean little if creative tests rewrite the fold mid-flight while media buyers are scaling.',
