      'When teams need a first draft under time pressure, structured generators can sketch an inclusions-forward outline from your fact list, then writers should strip every adjective that is not backed by a countable line item. Speed helps only when the packing list remains the spine of the page and marketing flourish stays in the margin where disputes cannot reach it.',
