      'Store the promise version that was live at purchase when systems allow, or date-stamp policy pages, so you can show what the customer agreed to. Updating the product page after a slow week without archival discipline weakens your side of the story even when your fulfillment was reasonable under the terms originally displayed.',
      'Mine chargeback reason codes quarterly and rewrite the top mismatch sentences. If not-received clusters around a carrier lane, fix logistics and the copy that oversold speed. Words alone will not patch a broken lane, but words that matched reality make valid deliveries defensible and reduce the emotional fuel that turns a late box into a chargeback.',
