      'For large catalogs, write collection copy in tiers: pillar categories get full frameworks and FAQs; niche collections get a tight purpose statement and one differentiator. Matching effort to assortment size keeps quality high where traffic concentrates without forcing empty poetry onto tiny grids that change weekly.',
