      'Time-boxed sequential tests usually beat messy overlapping edits for lean teams. Run version A long enough for your volume — often seven to fourteen days — then run version B across a matching window that respects weekday patterns. Avoid launching an unrelated sitewide sale mid-test unless the sale itself is the hypothesis. Annotations in analytics are cheap insurance against false crowning ceremonies.',
