      'Offer-copy tests need honesty guardrails before launch day. Shipping thresholds, gifts with purchase, and countdown claims must be true for the shopper\'s region and cart composition. False urgency can spike a week and scar trust for a year. Loop ops and legal in before marketing schedules a victory thread.',
      'When traffic is too thin for confident conversion reads, lean on directional instrumentation: scroll depth to specs, FAQ expansion, size-guide clicks, and related-product engagement. These cannot replace purchase statistics, but they reveal whether new copy invites exploration or confusion, which is better than arguing for months with no signal at all.',
