      'Before-and-after expectation photos help transformative products without overclaiming. Show realistic results and state conditions: lighting, time elapsed, surface type. Optimistic filters may appear in ads only if the PDP immediately corrects the story with calmer evidence. Misaligned expectation engineering is a CPA problem wearing a creative costume.',
